{
  "fps": 30,
  "durationInFrames": 7907,
  "narrated": true,
  "defaultLanguage": "en",
  "scenes": [
    "The invitation",
    "Two tiny signals",
    "The shared code",
    "A message arrives",
    "The hidden box",
    "How many questions?",
    "The picnic clue",
    "Your turn"
  ],
  "workingTitle": {
    "zh": "只有0和1，怎么说一句话？",
    "en": "How Can 0 and 1 Send a Message?"
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "fa02-01-01",
      "scene": 1,
      "visual": "world",
      "zh": "纸条过不去。米娅怎么邀请对面的里奥来玩？",
      "en": "The note won't fit! How can Mia invite Leo to play?",
      "leadInSeconds": 1.8,
      "from": 0,
      "duration": 199,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 57,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 187,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 3.74,
        "zh": 4.32
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-01-02",
      "scene": 1,
      "visual": "card",
      "zh": "两个太空舱，只靠一条管道连接。",
      "en": "Their space pods are linked by one tiny pipe.",
      "from": 199,
      "duration": 117,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 105,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 3.34,
        "zh": 3.38
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-01-03",
      "scene": 1,
      "visual": "rules",
      "zh": "游戏规定，每次只能送一颗珠子。金色表示一，蓝色表示零。",
      "en": "One little ball goes through at a time. Gold means one. Blue means zero.",
      "from": 316,
      "duration": 220,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 208,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 6.82,
        "zh": 6.76
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-01-04",
      "scene": 1,
      "visual": "challenge",
      "zh": "只靠这两种记号，你能把一句话传过去吗？",
      "en": "Could you send a message with only those two kinds of signal?",
      "hold": 1.2,
      "from": 536,
      "duration": 174,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 126,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 3.8,
        "zh": 4.1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-02-01",
      "scene": 2,
      "visual": "one-bit",
      "zh": "先看一颗珠子。它只有两种可能。",
      "en": "Start with one little ball. It has just two possible values.",
      "from": 710,
      "duration": 155,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 143,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 4.64,
        "zh": 3.98
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-02-02",
      "scene": 2,
      "visual": "two-bits",
      "zh": "两颗排在一起，就有四种不同的排法。顺序也算数。",
      "en": "Put two in a row, and there are four different patterns. Their order matters.",
      "from": 865,
      "duration": 177,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 165,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 4.9,
        "zh": 5.4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-02-03",
      "scene": 2,
      "visual": "bit-name",
      "zh": "每个零或一，叫一个比特。现在，把八个比特排成一组。",
      "en": "Each zero or one is called a bit. Now put eight bits in a group.",
      "from": 1042,
      "duration": 204,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 192,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 5.0,
        "zh": 6.28
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-02-04",
      "scene": 2,
      "visual": "byte",
      "zh": "这样一组叫一个字节。它有二百五十六种不同的排法。",
      "en": "That group is a byte. It can have two hundred and fifty-six different patterns.",
      "from": 1246,
      "duration": 195,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 183,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 4.72,
        "zh": 6.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-03-01",
      "scene": 3,
      "visual": "codebooks",
      "zh": "两边用同一张表。开玩之前，就得约好每种排法代表什么。",
      "en": "Before the game, they agreed on the same code table. Both ends must read it the same way.",
      "from": 1441,
      "duration": 206,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 194,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 5.52,
        "zh": 6.36
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-03-02",
      "scene": 3,
      "visual": "weights",
      "zh": "从右往左，每一格的数值翻一倍。右边是一，旁边是二，再旁边是四。",
      "en": "Reading from right to left, each place is worth twice as much: one, two, four, and so on.",
      "from": 1647,
      "duration": 242,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 230,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 6.98,
        "zh": 7.56
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-03-03",
      "scene": 3,
      "visual": "letter-a",
      "zh": "只取六十四和一，加起来六十五。表里对应的是字母 A。",
      "en": "Use the sixty-four and one places. That makes sixty-five: the letter A in their table.",
      "from": 1889,
      "duration": 205,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 193,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 6.32,
        "zh": 5.92
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-03-04",
      "scene": 3,
      "visual": "padding",
      "zh": "前面的零也要送。说好八颗一组，就收满八颗再读。",
      "en": "Send the leading zeros too. They agreed to read a letter after all eight balls arrive.",
      "from": 2094,
      "duration": 188,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 176,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 5.74,
        "zh": 4.86
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-03-05",
      "scene": 3,
      "visual": "ascii",
      "zh": "这次用阿斯基表，字母用八位来写。换别的表，就要按那张表的规矩。",
      "en": "Here they use ASCII letters written with eight bits. Another code table could use different rules.",
      "from": 2282,
      "duration": 212,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 200,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 5.48,
        "zh": 6.54
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-04-01",
      "scene": 4,
      "visual": "send-p",
      "zh": "米娅开始发邀请。第一个字母是 P，按编码表，一颗一颗送。",
      "en": "Mia sends her invitation. The first letter is P. She sends its pattern, one ball at a time.",
      "minSeconds": 7,
      "from": 2494,
      "duration": 277,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 265,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 6.6,
        "zh": 8.72
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-04-02",
      "scene": 4,
      "visual": "send-play",
      "zh": "接着是 L、A、Y。每收满八颗，接收屏上就出现一个字母。",
      "en": "Then come L, A and Y. Every eight balls give Leo another letter on his screen.",
      "minSeconds": 12,
      "from": 2771,
      "duration": 372,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 360,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 6.2,
        "zh": 7.38
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-04-03",
      "scene": 4,
      "visual": "received",
      "zh": "拼起来是 PLAY，一起来玩！纸条没过去，意思已经到了。",
      "en": "The letters spell PLAY. The note stayed behind, but the invitation got through.",
      "minSeconds": 5.4,
      "from": 3143,
      "duration": 191,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 179,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 5.26,
        "zh": 5.84
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-05-01",
      "scene": 5,
      "visual": "boxes",
      "zh": "开玩前，米娅还藏了个小礼物。就在里奥面前的十个盒子里。",
      "en": "Before the game, Mia hid a little gift in one of the ten boxes in Leo's cargo bay.",
      "minSeconds": 5.8,
      "from": 3334,
      "duration": 186,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 174,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 5.52,
        "zh": 5.2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-05-02",
      "scene": 5,
      "visual": "questions-rule",
      "zh": "他们先约好一套是否问题。里奥按顺序提问，米娅用珠子回答。",
      "en": "They agreed on a set of yes-or-no questions. Leo follows it. Mia replies with a gold or blue ball.",
      "from": 3520,
      "duration": 233,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 221,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 7.26,
        "zh": 6.76
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-05-03",
      "scene": 5,
      "visual": "bad-question",
      "zh": "如果挨个问，是一号吗，是二号吗，没猜中的盒子还剩一大堆。",
      "en": "Is it box one? Box two? If the answers are no, almost all the boxes remain.",
      "from": 3753,
      "duration": 229,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 217,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 6.06,
        "zh": 7.12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-05-04",
      "scene": 5,
      "visual": "guess-1",
      "zh": "换个问法：号码比五大吗？是。前面五个盒子都不用看了。",
      "en": "Try this: is the number greater than five? Yes. Five boxes disappear at once.",
      "from": 3982,
      "duration": 200,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 188,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 5.96,
        "zh": 6.14
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-05-05",
      "scene": 5,
      "visual": "guess-2",
      "zh": "比八大吗？否。现在只剩六、七、八。",
      "en": "Greater than eight? No. Only six, seven and eight remain.",
      "from": 4182,
      "duration": 200,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 188,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 5.62,
        "zh": 6.14
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-05-06",
      "scene": 5,
      "visual": "guess-3",
      "zh": "比六大吗？是。剩下七和八。",
      "en": "Greater than six? Yes. That leaves seven and eight.",
      "from": 4382,
      "duration": 152,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 140,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 4.54,
        "zh": 4.02
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-05-07",
      "scene": 5,
      "visual": "guess-4",
      "zh": "比七大吗？否。找到了，七号盒子！",
      "en": "Greater than seven? No. There it is: box seven!",
      "from": 4534,
      "duration": 176,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 164,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 4.42,
        "zh": 5.34
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-06-01",
      "scene": 6,
      "visual": "tree-three",
      "zh": "三次是否回答，最多分出八种结果。十个盒子，装不下。",
      "en": "Three yes-or-no answers can distinguish at most eight outcomes. That cannot cover ten boxes.",
      "from": 4710,
      "duration": 217,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 205,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 6.32,
        "zh": 6.72
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-06-02",
      "scene": 6,
      "visual": "tree-four",
      "zh": "四次最多能分出十六种。问题问得合适，最坏四次也能找出这十个里的任何一个。",
      "en": "Four answers allow sixteen outcomes. With suitable questions, four always suffice for any of the ten boxes.",
      "from": 4927,
      "duration": 251,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 239,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 7.22,
        "zh": 7.84
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-06-03",
      "scene": 6,
      "visual": "thousand",
      "zh": "就算有一千个，十次也够。前提是每次尽量把剩下的分成数量接近的两组。",
      "en": "Even a thousand possibilities need only ten answers, if each question splits the remaining choices as evenly as possible.",
      "from": 5178,
      "duration": 258,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 246,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 8.1,
        "zh": 7.8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-07-01",
      "scene": 7,
      "visual": "fruit",
      "zh": "盒子找到了，里面是哪种点心？候选是香蕉、苹果、葡萄和西瓜。",
      "en": "The box is found. Which snack is inside: a banana, an apple, grapes, or watermelon?",
      "from": 5436,
      "duration": 240,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 228,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 7.44,
        "zh": 7.48
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-07-02",
      "scene": 7,
      "visual": "fruit-red",
      "zh": "先问，图上有红色吗？是。香蕉和葡萄先放一边。",
      "en": "Is it red in these pictures? Yes. Put the banana and grapes aside.",
      "from": 5676,
      "duration": 192,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 180,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 4.5,
        "zh": 5.88
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-07-03",
      "scene": 7,
      "visual": "fruit-seeds",
      "zh": "图上能看见种子吗？能，原来是这块西瓜。两问就找到了。",
      "en": "Can you see seeds? Yes. It is the watermelon slice. Two questions found it.",
      "afterHoldSeconds": 5.0,
      "from": 5868,
      "duration": 368,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 206,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 6.14,
        "zh": 6.76
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-07-04",
      "scene": 7,
      "visual": "fruit-tree",
      "zh": "这里两问够用，是因为问题把它们分开了。随便问两个问题，可不一定行。",
      "en": "Two questions work here because the questions separate the choices. Any two questions will not necessarily do.",
      "from": 6236,
      "duration": 245,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 233,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 7.4,
        "zh": 7.64
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-08-01",
      "scene": 8,
      "visual": "picnic",
      "zh": "他按下发送键，一颗金色小球传了回去：收到啦！",
      "en": "Leo presses Send. A gold signal carries his reply: got it!",
      "minSeconds": 6.0,
      "from": 6481,
      "duration": 192,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 180,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 4.82,
        "zh": 4.94
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-08-02",
      "scene": 8,
      "visual": "lights",
      "zh": "用电灯也行：关掉表示零，打开表示一。",
      "en": "The balls carry our message. A light can send the same signals: off for zero, on for one.",
      "from": 6673,
      "duration": 200,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 188,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 6.14,
        "zh": 4.62
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-08-03",
      "scene": 8,
      "visual": "lab",
      "zh": "到网页实验室里，点亮六十四和一，看看会不会出现 A。",
      "en": "In the online lab, switch on sixty-four and one. See whether the letter A appears.",
      "from": 6873,
      "duration": 198,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 186,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 6.1,
        "zh": 5.2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-08-04",
      "scene": 8,
      "visual": "worksheet",
      "zh": "也可以打印这张表。你写一条消息，给孩子解；再换孩子出题。",
      "en": "Or print the table. Write a message for your child to decode, then let them make one for you.",
      "from": 7071,
      "duration": 209,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 197,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 6.46,
        "zh": 6.2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-08-05",
      "scene": 8,
      "visual": "scope",
      "zh": "今天只试英文字母。一个字节有八位，不代表每种文字都一个字节就够。",
      "en": "Today we tried English letters. Eight bits make a byte, but not every character fits in one byte.",
      "from": 7280,
      "duration": 249,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 237,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 6.28,
        "zh": 7.8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa02-08-06",
      "scene": 8,
      "visual": "invite",
      "zh": "来 Lucas Academy 一起玩：如果你们之间也只有一根小管子，你最想给对方说什么？",
      "en": "Join us at Lucas Academy. If you had only a tiny pipe between you, what would you tell your friend?",
      "hold": 5,
      "from": 7529,
      "duration": 378,
      "speechOffsetFrames": 3,
      "bodyDurationFrames": 216,
      "voiceSeconds": {
        "en": 7.08,
        "zh": 6.9
      }
    }
  ],
